# Build artifacts and deps (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
# TypeScript incremental-build state. Gitignored but NOT excluded here until
# now — a real, repo-wide bug this was: a stale local .tsbuildinfo (mismatched
# against a `dist/` regenerated or moved outside tsc's knowledge, e.g. after
# `mv`/`rm -rf dist` without also clearing this file) gets copied verbatim
# into the build context and makes tsc trust its own stale bookkeeping over
# reality, silently skipping real compilation — confirmed to reproduce with
# @rag/core/@rag/db emitting only .d.ts (or nothing) instead of real .js
# output, with zero error message. Every app's Dockerfile (api/mcp/worker/web)
# runs a fresh `pnpm ... build` after COPYing packages/apps, so any developer
# machine with a locally-built (possibly stale) workspace could hit this.
**/*.tsbuildinfo


# VCS / editor / local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.serena
.worktrees
.scratch*
.remember
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets and local env (never bake into an image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local data and logs
postgres-data
**/*.log

# Docs and scratch (not needed to build/run) — except docs/compliance, which
# the COMPLIANCE_MODE=client-data boot gate reads at runtime (see
# packages/core/src/config.ts's defaultCheckDpa).
docs/*
!docs/compliance
*.md
!README.md
!docs/compliance/*.md
sesh.sh
PATHFINDER-*
journey-into-rag-system.md
